# 13.1 AI Pipeline Overview

---

# 13.1.1 Purpose

The AI Pipeline defines the end-to-end workflow responsible for transforming raw legal documents and organization policies into explainable compliance reports.

The pipeline shall operate as a sequence of independent processing stages connected through asynchronous jobs and well-defined interfaces.

Each stage shall produce structured outputs that become inputs for the next stage.

The pipeline shall support:

- Incremental execution
- Retry mechanisms
- Parallel processing
- Job monitoring
- Audit logging
- Failure recovery

---

# 13.1.2 Pipeline Overview

LexisGraph consists of two independent pipelines.

## Pipeline A

Legal Knowledge Preparation

Runs only when administrators add or update laws.

## Pipeline B

Organization Compliance Analysis

Runs whenever an organization uploads a policy.

Keeping these pipelines separate prevents repeatedly processing legal documents for every organization.

