# 13.1.6 Stage Responsibilities

## Document Acquisition

Responsible for:

- Receiving uploaded files
- File validation
- Metadata recording
- Duplicate detection

Output

Validated document

---

## Document Processing

Responsible for:

- OCR
- Text extraction
- Cleaning
- Section detection
- Clause segmentation

Output

Structured document

---

## Knowledge Construction

Responsible for:

- Named entity recognition
- Legal entity extraction
- Relationship discovery
- Graph creation

Output

