---

# 13.1.18 Acceptance Criteria

The AI Pipeline shall be considered complete when:

✓ Legal ingestion and compliance analysis are independent.

✓ Every stage produces structured outputs.

✓ Heavy tasks execute asynchronously.

✓ Retry and monitoring mechanisms exist.

✓ Failures are isolated.

✓ Reports are fully traceable.

✓ Pipeline stages are independently scalable.

---

# 13.1.19 Summary

The AI Pipeline provides the execution framework for the LexisGraph intelligence layer. By separating legal knowledge preparation from organization-specific compliance analysis and implementing asynchronous, event-driven processing with full traceability, the pipeline delivers scalable, explainable, and reliable AI-powered compliance assessments while remaining adaptable to future regulatory and technological changes.

